Maki Auto Approve

The default reviewer prompts are copied from OpenAI Codex's Guardian implementation:
https://github.com/openai/codex/tree/e4568a3538c9cab6627d64ff8cdfc7d98b79b7db/codex-rs/prompts/templates/guardian

OpenAI Codex is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
The unmodified policy template, default security policy, and assessment parser
reference are bundled under vendor/codex; source.json records upstream paths and
Git blob hashes. The generated Lua prompt bundle preserves the source text.
Only the rendered Execution Environment section is replaced to describe Maki's
permissions, evidence transport, restricted inspection tools, and human fallback.
The output contract is extracted unchanged from the assessment source. The Lua
assessment parser is a port of that source's response interpretation.
